  "description": "Serve up fresh organic style, Japanese-inspired brush elegance, and authentic hand-painted personality with Sushi Menu Handwritten! Designed as an expressive Asian-style handwritten display font, each character features dynamic brush strokes, tall natural letter stems, and a subtle calligraphic sweep. Its clean yet handcrafted aesthetic brings an inviting, authentic culinary touch to restaurant menus, branding, and food packaging.\nIdeal for Japanese restaurant menus, sushi bar signage, Asian fusion food packaging, chef branding, recipe books, culinary quote prints, stickers, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
